Subject: [PATCH] heat_freshwater_tsubouchi.jl: gateway heat and freshwater on
 Tsubouchi et al.'s references

Converts the model's and GLORYS's gateway heat (ours: 0 degC, Bering -1.9)
and freshwater (ours: 34.8) to Tsubouchi et al.'s (2018) references
(1.01 degC, 34.67) and prints them beside their Table 3 annual means
(references/tsubouchi2018_table3.csv, signs positive into the Arctic).
Reads existing output; no new run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
